.DS_Store

# Cargo.lock IS tracked. The usual "libraries don't commit a lock" convention
# assumes a published crate whose consumers resolve their own graph; this one
# is `publish = false`, so the only thing the lock governs is `git clone &&
# cargo build` in this repo — where it is what keeps a reviewer's resolve, and
# a fresh checkout's, identical to the one the suite was run against.
